  "They draft and suggest. They never decide.": "Ils rédigent et suggèrent. Ils ne décident jamais.",
  "Thirty minutes would do. Somewhere between fifty and a hundred dollars per fifteen minutes.": "Trente minutes suffiraient. Entre cinquante et cent dollars par tranche de quinze minutes.",
  "Thirty-four years in procurement, twelve of them as a director, puts you in the top band for this kind of advice.": "Trente-quatre ans dans les achats, dont douze à la direction, vous placent dans la tranche haute pour ce type d’aide.",
